    <briefdescription>
<para>class of Bernstein polynomials </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>see definition: <verbatim>   Weisstein, Eric W. &quot;Bernstein Polynomial.&quot; From MathWorld--A
   Wolfram Web Resource.
   &lt;http://mathworld.wolfram.com/BernsteinPolynomial.html&gt;

   The Bernstein polynomials \form#168 are defined as
</verbatim></para><para><formula id="169">\[ B_{i,n}(x) \equiv \left( \begin{array}{c} n \\ i \end{array} \right) x^i (1-x)^{n-i} \]</formula> </para>    </detaileddescription>
